# piglit-quick-gl.flakes: the tests and subtests of piglit-quick-gl.txt.gz
# that are not judged, one extended regular expression a line, searched for
# in the name.
#
# The 'volatile' memory barrier subtests of the geometry and tessellation
# evaluation stages at modulus 64 read the second store before the first on
# the testing PC's D3D12 virgl in both guests (dev-log/84-locks/upstream.md),
# and the test's own row fails with them; its other subtests are judged.
# The venus suite's case reads this file too, so they go unjudged there.
^spec@arb_shader_image_load_store@shader-mem-barrier$
^spec@arb_shader_image_load_store@shader-mem-barrier@(geometry|tessellation evaluation) shader/'volatile' qualifier memory barrier test/modulus=64$
